  "title": "Balancing Exhibition Costs and Environmental Impact",
  "content_html": "<main class=\"p-page\">\n      <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n      <ul class=\"c-breadcrumb\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp\"><span itemprop=\"name\" >HOME</span></a><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"1\" /></li><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a itemprop=\"item\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Reasons for Selection</span></a><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"2\" /></li><li class=\"c-breadcrumb__item\" itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><span itemprop=\"name\">Balancing Exhibition Costs and Environmental Impact</span><meta itemprop=\"position\" content=\"3\" /></li></ul>    </div>\n    <section class=\"p-page__header\">\n      <div class=\"l-container-fluid\">\n        <div class=\"p-page__title c-title-sec \">\n          <small class=\"p-page__parent-title p-page__title--fade\">Reasons for Selection</small>\n          <p class=\"c-text--en js-split\">\n            why choose us          </p>\n          <h1 class=\"c-text--ja p-page__title--fade\">Balancing Exhibition Costs and Environmental Impact</h1>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n                      <div class=\"p-page__thumbnail\">\n          <div class=\"u-media g-thumbnail\">\n            <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/640788444-1920x1081.jpeg\" alt=\"\">\n          </div>\n        </div>\n          </section>\n  \n\n  <div class=\"wp_block-content\">\n    \n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box alignwide is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__header is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading is-decorated-top\">A System That Lowers Exhibition Costs the More You Use It</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group p-page-column-box__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Conventional exhibition booths often incur significant costs each time because design, drafting, and layout adjustments are all outsourced to contractors. Re:Booth (Re:ブース) not only reuses materials but also allows design and layout concepts to be applied to subsequent exhibitions, thereby reducing unnecessary outsourcing and rework, leading to continuous cost reduction.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-1a05964e wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1140\" height=\"829\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/l1.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-553\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/l1.jpg 1140w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/l1-960x698.jpg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/l1-450x327.jpg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/l1-768x558.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1140px) 100vw, 1140px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Design Examples</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1140\" height=\"829\" src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/l2.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-554\" srcset=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/l2.jpg 1140w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/l2-960x698.jpg 960w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/l2-450x327.jpg 450w, https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/l2-768x558.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1140px) 100vw, 1140px\" /><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Layout Image</figcaption></figure>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Re:Booth has a system in place to proceed without unnecessary outsourcing, such as creating full-scale layouts using PowerPoint.<br>Since the initial cost starts from 1,000,000 yen, and from the second use onward from 500,000 yen, this also enables continuous reduction of exhibition costs.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n    <div class=\"p-archive-list__link\">\n              <div class=\"p-page__list\">\n                      <a class=\"p-page__card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/design-quality/\">\n\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__header\">\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__thumbnail u-media\">\n                                                          <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.2-450x253.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                  </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__body\">\n                <h3 class=\"p-page-card__title\">Uncompromising Design</h3>\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__excerpt\">\n                  Expanding Booth Expression with High Freedom Using a Truss Structure Re:Booth allows for flexible shapes by utilizing trusses for the framework, and can also accommodate hanging monitors. We accommodate various exhibition booth designs according to your requests while combining display panels and [&amp;hellip;]                </div>\n              </div>\n            </a>\n                      <a class=\"p-page__card\" href=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/why-choose-us/reuse/\">\n\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__header\">\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__thumbnail u-media\">\n                                                          <img src=\"https://rebooth.co.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/choose.3-450x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">\n                                  </div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"p-page-card__body\">\n                <h3 class=\"p-page-card__title\">Design Capabilities Based on Reuse</h3>\n                <div class=\"p-page-card__excerpt\">\n                  Reducing Environmental Impact with Reusable Materials In Japan, approximately 700 exhibitions are held annually, and many companies set up booths for just a few days of participation. Conventional wooden booths are often dismantled and disposed of after the event, creating a significant burden [&amp;hellip;]                </div>\n              </div>\n            </a>\n          \n        </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n</main>",
